Third-party licences for Orunmila
================================

Orunmila has no runtime dependencies. The `dependencies` field in package.json
is empty, and the npm package contains only Orunmila's own files. There is no
third-party licence text or NOTICE file to carry forward with it.

If a runtime dependency is ever added, its name, licence and copyright notice
go in this file. The test suite (test/license-files.js) fails until it is
named here.

Development tools
-----------------

These are installed by `npm ci` in a git clone, to lint, format and measure
test coverage. They are never part of the npm package.

  @eslint/js   MIT
  c8           ISC
  eslint       MIT
  prettier     MIT

Each of their own dependencies is listed with its licence in
package-lock.json. All are under permissive licences (MIT, ISC, Apache-2.0,
BlueOak-1.0.0, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, 0BSD). The test suite fails if a
locked package has any other licence, or none.
